<title>JAPAN: Reuters average March Tapis assessed at $22.27.</title>
<headline>Reuters average March Tapis assessed at $22.27.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average Reuters price for Malaysian Tapis for March was $22.27.</p>
<p>Malaysia's Petronas uses Reuters morning quotes in its monthly term crude formula. Reuters prices:</p>
<p>    March 3  $22.40  12  $22.43  21  $22.38</p>
<p>	    4  $22.23  13  $22.25  24  $22.65</p>
<p>	    5  $22.40  14  $22.40  25  $22.25</p>
<p>	    6  $22.65  17  $22.30  26  $21.90</p>
<p>	    7  $22.33  18  $21.70  27  $21.98</p>
<p>	   10  $22.70  19  $21.75  28  $21.85</p>
<p>	   11  $22.68  20  $22.58  31  $21.85</p>
</text>
